==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Calamary]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can essentially solo this stage. If you want to be safe, bring a Unit Attack UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] and/or Bring [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]].

